The source is "ab".
The goal is "ba".
The last is the last position of source.
The valid is 1.
The sizesource is the number of characters in source.
The sizegoal is the number of characters in goal.
If sizesource is not sizegoal, set valid to 0.
The first is -1.
The second is -1.
The misses is 0.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The symbol is character spot of source.
The wanted is character spot of goal.
If symbol is not wanted and misses is 0, set first to spot.
If symbol is not wanted and misses is 1, set second to spot.
If symbol is not wanted, add 1 to misses.

The twin is 0.
For every left from 0 to last.
For every right from left plus 1 to last.
The leftsymbol is character left of source.
The rightsymbol is character right of source.
If leftsymbol is rightsymbol, set twin to 1.

The answer is 0.
If valid is 1 and misses is 0, set answer to twin.
If valid is 1 and misses is 2.
The leftletter is character first of source.
The rightletter is character second of goal.
The backletter is character second of source.
The frontletter is character first of goal.
If leftletter is rightletter and backletter is frontletter, set answer to 1.

If answer is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
